WEBVTT

00:08:58.909 --> 00:09:03.789
I interviewed dozens of parents and kids
to find out what they were doing.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:08.127
And so I want to share
with you what I learned,

00:09:08.168 --> 00:09:10.921
and I want to share with you
five strategies

00:09:10.921 --> 00:09:13.966
that I'm actually doing with my children

00:09:14.008 --> 00:09:15.134
and that honestly,

00:09:15.175 --> 00:09:19.388
I think every parent
should be doing with their children

00:09:19.388 --> 00:09:23.642
to disrupt our conventional
way of parenting.

00:09:24.852 --> 00:09:26.562
So, number one,

00:09:26.604 --> 00:09:28.689
don't give them an allowance.

00:09:28.981 --> 00:09:30.399
(Applause)